        dct:description "Module and function docstrings map every equation and solver step directly to Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) J. Theor. Biol. 364:420-430 Sec. 2-4, Chirat, Moulton & Goriely (2013) PNAS 110:6015-6020, Moulton et al. (2012) J. Theor. Biol. 311:69-79, and the 3 formal Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_077_mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling.lean`." ;
